%% Intrak V2 - Document Upload & Approval Sequence Diagram
%% Paste this into: https://mermaid.live/

sequenceDiagram
    participant Student
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant DocService as Document Service
    participant FileStorage as File Storage
    participant Database as PostgreSQL
    participant EmailService as Email Service
    participant Instructor
    
    Note over Student,Instructor: Document Upload & Approval Flow
    
    Student->>Frontend: 1. Select Document File
    Frontend->>Frontend: 2. Validate File (size, type)
    Student->>Frontend: 3. Submit Upload
    
    Frontend->>API: 4. POST /api/documents<br/>(with file + metadata)
    API->>Auth: 5. Verify JWT Token
    Auth-->>API: 6. Token Valid
    
    API->>DocService: 7. Process Document Upload
    DocService->>FileStorage: 8. Save File to Storage
    FileStorage-->>DocService: 9. File Path
    
    DocService->>Database: 10. Create Document Record<br/>(status: PENDING)
    Database-->>DocService: 11. Document Created
    
    DocService->>EmailService: 12. Send Notification<br/>to Reviewer
    EmailService-->>DocService: 13. Email Sent
    
    DocService-->>API: 14. Upload Success
    API-->>Frontend: 15. Success Response
    Frontend-->>Student: 16. Show Success Message
    
    Note over Instructor,Database: Document Review Process
    
    Instructor->>Frontend: 17. View Pending Documents
    Frontend->>API: 18. GET /api/documents?status=PENDING
    API->>Auth: 19. Verify Token & Role
    Auth-->>API: 20. Authorized (Instructor)
    API->>Database: 21. Query Pending Documents
    Database-->>API: 22. Return Documents
    API-->>Frontend: 23. Document List
    Frontend-->>Instructor: 24. Display Documents
    
    Instructor->>Frontend: 25. Review Document<br/>(Approve/Reject)
    Frontend->>API: 26. PUT /api/documents/:id/approve<br/>or /reject
    API->>Auth: 27. Verify Token & Role
    Auth-->>API: 28. Authorized
    API->>DocService: 29. Update Document Status
    DocService->>Database: 30. Update Document<br/>(status: APPROVED/REJECTED)
    Database-->>DocService: 31. Updated
    
    DocService->>EmailService: 32. Notify Student<br/>of Status Change
    EmailService-->>DocService: 33. Email Sent
    DocService-->>API: 34. Update Success
    API-->>Frontend: 35. Success Response
    Frontend-->>Instructor: 36. Show Success
    
    Note over Student: Student receives notification
    
    Student->>Frontend: 37. Check Document Status
    Frontend->>API: 38. GET /api/documents/:id
    API->>Database: 39. Query Document
    Database-->>API: 40. Document with Status
    API-->>Frontend: 41. Document Data
    Frontend-->>Student: 42. Show Status (Approved/Rejected)


